<title>US Auction | 12 Days | Ends Nov 15th</title>
<description>A couple things to know:

1. Please bid with at least $1 increments.

2. US only auction, ends late Saturday evening, November 15th.

3. Payment is accepted within 5 days of order confirmation by PayPal (I can cover fees), and BGG given 3% commission.

4. Generally I can get things shipped in 2 days at the most after receiving payment (often within 24 hours).

5. I utilize PirateShip for shipping. Local pickup in Des Moines, Iowa 50311. Shipping is generally $10-$20 depending on increasing size, weight, and distance. 1 game is generally 9-12 with increasing distance from IA. A few games is generally 13-16. Several heavy games in a big box end up closer to 20.

6. Starting bid is a guaranteed sale. BUN (for bundle) is a discounted BIN for buying at least 2 games.

7. All games are in good to very good condition with notes and pictures on anything worth considering. "Good" as in light shelfwear/whitening of linen finish.

8. I reserve the right to end auction items with or without bids (excluding BUN or BIN) if I receive a buy it now type offer elsewhere (marketplace, geekmail, crossposted local listings, etc).</description>

